/-!
# Quotient lifting and E-generation

These results establish E.1.10(7), reverse lifting with equal intrinsic
two-residual images; E.1.10(6), generation of a normal odd-prime section;
and E.1.10(8), generation across a two-closed normal supplement. The proofs
follow the source order (7), (6), (8), with the actual quotient maps, local
tau subgroups, and rank bounds.

Source: Aschbacher--Smith, *The Classification of Quasithin Groups*,
E.1.10, printed pp.211--212.
-/
